## 📊 **Decision Matrix**

| **Scenario** | **Exception Type** | **Reason** | **Caller Action** |
|--------------|-------------------|------------|-------------------|
| **External Service Down** | ✅ **Checked** | Temporary, recoverable | Retry later, fallback |
| **Approval Pending** | ✅ **Checked** | Expected business flow | Wait, notify user, follow up |
| **Contract Conflicts** | ✅ **Checked** | Business validation | Ask user to resolve |
| **Invalid State Transition** | ❌ **Unchecked** | Programming error | Fix the bug |
| **Data Integrity Violation** | ❌ **Unchecked** | Serious application bug | Fix data validation |
| **Configuration Error** | ❌ **Unchecked** | Setup/deployment issue | Fix configuration |

